<TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD>Monetize its approximately $450 million investment in the Abernathy Joint Venture at a premium to invested capital, while simplifying
